1
00:00:16,480 --> 00:00:21,870
Wet cobblestones reflect the night

2
00:00:23,120 --> 00:00:28,160
Beneath a flicker of street light

3
00:00:29,500 --> 00:00:33,490
I lean in close to feel your breath

4
00:00:35,810 --> 00:00:43,840
My pink wool coat against your chest

5
00:00:45,420 --> 00:00:51,179
You step right back into the dark

6
00:00:51,679 --> 00:00:57,789
And crush this fragile little spark

7
00:00:58,039 --> 00:01:02,030
You grab your helmet like a shield

8
00:01:02,149 --> 00:01:10,670
And leave me on this empty field

9
00:01:14,290 --> 00:01:19,879
The engine screams into the fog

10
00:01:20,769 --> 00:01:26,370
Blue smoke rises like a smog

11
00:01:27,069 --> 00:01:32,590
I watch your taillight fade away

12
00:01:33,200 --> 00:01:39,920
With so much left I had to say

13
00:01:40,049 --> 00:01:46,280
Was every word a practiced lie?

14
00:01:46,500 --> 00:01:52,390
Why didn’t you even try?

15
00:01:52,629 --> 00:01:56,909
Am I a fool for standing bare,

16
00:01:56,959 --> 00:02:17,060
Offering love you couldn't bear?

17
00:02:30,969 --> 00:02:37,280
I walk the quiet streets alone

18
00:02:37,500 --> 00:02:43,759
The winter wind cuts to the bone

19
00:02:44,000 --> 00:02:50,280
My hands are burning in my coat

20
00:02:50,500 --> 00:02:56,560
A silent scream inside my throat

21
00:02:56,639 --> 00:03:02,400
You chose your silence over me

22
00:03:02,990 --> 00:03:08,500
A prisoner who won’t be free

23
00:03:09,500 --> 00:03:13,210
You fled the truth you couldn't face

24
00:03:13,219 --> 00:03:34,659
And left me in this freezing place

25
00:03:47,680 --> 00:03:51,810
You feared the fire in my chest

26
00:03:54,229 --> 00:04:00,000
And broke the heart you never guessed